/T (Zero cost after free credits: Gemma free tier, Kokoro open source. Low latency: < 1s TTS per sentence on GPU. Unlimited usage: Kokoro runs offline, no API billing. AMD-native: no NVIDIA lock-in, full GPU-acceleration via ROCm. Future roadmap: image-to-video \(Wan 2.2/LTX\) on AMD GPU for Creative Studio. Google Login and Logout , Sample Response , Download, Share features are additional integration in application.)
/E (Zero cost after free credits: Gemma free tier, Kokoro open source. Low latency: < 1s TTS per sentence on GPU. Unlimited usage: Kokoro runs offline, no API billing. AMD-native: no NVIDIA lock-in, full GPU-acceleration via ROCm. Future roadmap: image-to-video \(Wan 2.2/LTX\) on AMD GPU for Creative Studio. Google Login and Logout , Sample Response , Download, Share features are additional integration in application.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
169 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 45 0 R
/T (Gemma accesses Google AI Studio API on cloud infrastructure; optionally AMD-accelerated nodes. 4B active per forward pass -- suitable for both cloud and local ROCm deployment. Backend calls inference.googleapis.com/v1/models/gemma-4 with API key.)
/E (Gemma accesses Google AI Studio API on cloud infrastructure; optionally AMD-accelerated nodes. 4B active per forward pass -- suitable for both cloud and local ROCm deployment. Backend calls inference.googleapis.com/v1/models/gemma-4 with API key.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [10]
>>
