/E (Deployed in Radeon Cloud  GPU via Public URL Deployment for Public Web URL.  Command: python -m uvicorn main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 \(0=t bound to all interfaces\), for Backend server. Graceful CPU fallback when no GPU detected.)
