/Title (Audio pipeline runs on-device on AMD Radeon GPU via ROCm 6.0+ & PyTorch ROCm backend. Curated-transformers architecture works natively on AMD CDNA/RDNA GPUs. Install ROCm, then: pip install torch --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/rocm6.0 Runtime: torch.cuda.is_available\(\) returns True, KPipeline auto-routes to GPU. Less than 1s per sentence; zero NVIDIA or CUDA dependency.)
